      "message": "perf: merge Coordinator HTTP events and Codex startup fixes\n\nIntegrate original PR heads #1836, #1839, and #1842 with an ordinary three-parent merge. Preserve the original commits and refs.\n\nThe conflict-free 19-path tree passed the complete pnpm check and 60 combined Codex tests. Production latency acceptance remains pending under #1506."
